        "Content": "Spacious accommodation all at ground floor level (Approximately 101m2 / 1,091 sq ft) as seen in the attached photos, high quality video and virtual tour with accompanying 3D model & floorplan that accompanies this brochure."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Fully Renovated & Turnkey the main work of bringing the property up to date has already been carried out.\r\n- Three Well-Presented Bedrooms, each bedroom benefits from built-in wardrobe storage, helping to maximise usable space.\r\n- Bright Living & Dining Space with feature fireplace and mantle create a focal point, with an insert electric stove\r\n-  Modern Fitted Kitchen, upgraded to provide a contemporary and practical cooking space.\r\n- Exceptional Gardens are one of the property's strongest features and lovingly cared for\r\n- Two Patio Areas can potentially be used at different times of the day to take advantage of the available sunshine.\r\n- Large Private Yard & Parking with useful Outbuildings\r\n- Rural Setting with Accessibility to Coon village is approximately 1.7 km, Castlecomer 10 km , Kilkenny and Carlow 21 km.\r\nSERVICES: Own well & septic tank on site / oil fired central heating"
